  "all_ingredients_flat": "besan (chickpea flour), warm water, cilantro, minced onion, salt, Chaat Masala, jeera (cumin powder), haldi (turmeric powder), firm tofu, Garam Masala",
  "instructions": "Besan Cheela Batter: Mix besan (chickpea flour) with warm water to make a smooth thick batter. Add cilantro, minced onion, salt (to taste), Chaat Masala, jeera (cumin powder) & haldi (turmeric powder). Mix well.\nPour Besan Cheela Batter into waffle iron. Then place a slice of firm tofu and cover it with more batter on top. Alternately, we may dip tofu slices in batter and place them in waffle iron.\nOnce waffles are cooked in the waffle iron, slice them into halves and air fry for ~ 7 mins.\nGarnish the air fried waffle halves with salt (to taste), Chaat Masala & Garam Masala. Serve & enjoy!",
  "cooking_methods": [
    "waffle",
    "air-fry"
  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "Serve & enjoy!",
  "notes": "Besan Cheela Batter. A recipe with BEANS (chickpea flour, tofu), RAINBOW VEGGIES (onion), HERBS & SPICES (various).",
